---
import { ChevronDown, ExternalLink } from "lucide-astro";
import { website } from "../seo";
---

<!-- Data written directly in markup for maximum flexibility (no frontmatter) -->
<section class="pt-16 pb-16 lg:flex lg:items-start lg:gap-x-12" id="collaborate">
  <header
    class="mb-16 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-4 justify-between lg:flex-col lg:items-start"
  >
    <h2 class="text-4xl text-balance">
      Work, friendships, or something in between.
    </h2>

    <div class="flex items-center gap-x-4 flex-wrap gap-y-2">
      <a
        href={`mailto:${website.email}`}
        class="px-0 flex gap-x-1 mt-4 text-sm hover:underline underline-offset-2 text-nowrap text-muted-foreground font-medium"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        {`Write me an email`}
        <ExternalLink class="size-4 stroke-current" />
      </a>

      <a
        href={`https://forms.gle/qX6URxRFiDTu7xCX6`}
        class="px-0 flex gap-x-1 mt-4 text-sm lg:text-base hover:underline underline-offset-2 text-nowrap text-blue-600 font-medium"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        {`Request for Work via Questionnaire`}
        <ExternalLink class="size-4 stroke-current" />
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div id="collaboration-faq" class="grow accordion-container lg:max-w-md">
    <div class="ac">
      <h4 class="ac-header">
        <button type="button" class="ac-trigger">
          What services do I offer?
          <ChevronDown
            class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200"
          />
        </button>
      </h4>
      <div class="ac-panel" role="region">
        <p>
          I build, improve, and maintain Web and Mobile applications. That includes
          fullstack MVPs, UI implementation, bug fixes, third party integrations,
          testing, performance, accessibility, and overall product quality. On the
          backend, I primarily work with or build APIs.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ac">
      <h4 class="ac-header">
        <button type="button" class="ac-trigger">
          What's it like working with me?
          <ChevronDown
            class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200"
          />
        </button>
      </h4>
      <div class="ac-panel" role="region">
        <p>
          I work best with clear scope, defined responsibilities, and documented
          decisions. We'll keep communication, tasks, and feedback in a shared
          workspace, so everyone stays aligned. Unless we've agreed otherwise, I
          won't assume the role of designer, project manager, or business consultant.
          I don't operate like an on-demand chat. We'll agree on communication
          channels and response times upfront.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ac">
      <h4 class="ac-header">
        <button type="button" class="ac-trigger">
          What I don't do?
          <ChevronDown
            class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200"
          />
        </button>
      </h4>
      <div class="ac-panel" role="region">
        <p>
          I focus on web and mobile applications. I don't offer branding, graphic
          design, SEO, marketing, native mobile apps, desktop software, DevOps, or
          custom backend systems. If a project needs those, I'm happy to collaborate
          with specialists.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ac">
      <h4 class="ac-header">
        <button type="button" class="ac-trigger">
          How much will it cost me?
          <ChevronDown
            class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200"
          />
        </button>
      </h4>
      <div class="ac-panel" role="region">
        <p>
          Every project is quoted based on scope. Most work falls into three tiers:
          $10+ for fixes, $50+ for standard builds, and $200+ for custom software,
          business systems, and integrations. Hourly, milestone based, and equity
          based engagements are also available where appropriate.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ac">
      <h4 class="ac-header">
        <button type="button" class="ac-trigger">
          Can we just hang out?
          <ChevronDown
            class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200"
          />
        </button>
      </h4>
      <div class="ac-panel" role="region">
        <p>
          Absolutely. Not every conversation has to lead to a project. I'm always up
          for meeting interesting people. Fair warning though—I skip the small talk.
          I'd rather play football, watch a match or a film, explore somewhere new,
          or just work on something together.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #collaboration-faq .ac-container,
  #collaboration-faq .ac,
  #collaboration-faq .ac-trigger {
    background: transparent;
  }

  #collaboration-faq .ac {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  #collaboration-faq .ac-trigger {
    border: none;
    display: flex;
    flex: 1;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    text-align: start;
    cursor: pointer;
    @apply text-foreground text-base font-medium sm:text-lg;
  }

  #collaboration-faq .ac-trigger:focus,
  #collaboration-faq .ac-trigger:hover {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  #collaboration-faq .ac-trigger::after {
    content: "";
    display: none;
  }

  #collaboration-faq .ac-trigger[aria-expanded="true"] svg {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  #collaboration-faq .ac-content {
    overflow: hidden;
    animation-duration: 0.2s;
    animation-timing-function: ease-out;
    animation-fill-mode: forwards;
    padding-inline: 0px;
  }

  #collaboration-faq .ac-panel {
    @apply font-sans !text-sm;
  }

  #collaboration-faq .ac-panel > *:first-child {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
  #collaboration-faq .ac-panel > *:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  #collaboration-faq .ac-content[data-state="open"] {
    animation-name: accordion-down;
  }

  #collaboration-faq .ac {
    @apply border-x-transparent border-t-transparent border-b border-b-muted-foreground/15;
  }
</style>

<script>
  import Accordion from "accordion-js";
  import "accordion-js/dist/accordion.min.css";

  new Accordion("#collaboration-faq", {
    duration: 300,
    showMultiple: false,
    collapse: true,
    openOnInit: [0],
  });
</script>
